 uniform.\n    - **Linguistic Voice:** Human writing usually has a distinct voice, personal tone, or even minor imperfections. AI text can sound overly polished, generic, or emotionally detached.\n    - **Word Choice & Phrasing:** AI models can sometimes overuse certain "safe" words or create slightly unnatural or clichéd phrases.\n    - **Flow and Transitions:** AI-generated text can sometimes have abrupt or overly logical transitions that lack a natural human flow.\n2.  **Assign a Score:** Based on your analysis, provide a probability score from 0 to 100 using the rubric below. Be cautious; text that has been "humanized" may still contain subtle AI artifacts.\n3.  **Provide Justification:** In the \'analysis\' field, provide a detailed explanation for your score. You MUST cite specific examples or phrases from the text to justify your reasoning for each characteristic you evaluated.\n\n**Scoring Rubric:**\n- **0-20 (Very Likely Human):** Exhibits significant complexity, unique voice, and natural imperfections.\n- **21-50 (Likely Human):** Generally natural, but may have some uniform sentence structures or overly formal phrasing.\n- **51-80 (Likely AI):** Shows several signs of uniformity, lacks a distinct voice, and may have repetitive or unnatural phrasing.\n- **81-100 (Very Likely AI):** Highly uniform, generic, and lacks the nuance and "messiness" of authentic human writing.\n\n**Text to Analyze:**\n---\n{{{text}}}\n---`,\n    config: {\n        temperature: 0.3, // Slightly higher temp for more nuanced analysis\n    }\n});\n\nconst detectAiContentFlow = ai.defineFlow({\n    name: \'detectAiContentFlow\',\n    inputSchema: DetectAIInputSchema,\n    outputSchema: DetectAIOutputSchema,\n}, async (input: DetectAIInput) => {\n  try {\n    const result = await detectAiPrompt(input);\n    \n    if (!result) {\n      throw new Error(\'No output received from the model.\');\n    }\n\n    // Parse the JSON response\n    let output: DetectAIOutput;\n    try {\n      const jsonText = result.text || result.output || \'\';\n      output = JSON.parse(jsonText);\n    } catch (parseError) {\n      console.error(\'Failed to parse AI Detection JSON:\', parseError);\n      throw new Error(\'AI Detection returned invalid JSON\');\n    }\n\n    // Validate the parsed output\n    const validation = DetectAIOutputSchema.safeParse(output);\n    if (!validation.success) {\n      console.error(\'AI Detection output validation failed:\', validation.error);\n      throw new Error(\'AI Detection output does not match expected structure\');\n    }\n\n    return validation.data;\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error(\'Error in detectAiContentFlow:\', error);\n    throw new Error(`detectAiContent failed: ${error instanceof Error ? error.message : \'Unknown error\'}`);\n  }\n});\n\n\nexport async function detectAiContent(input: DetectAIInput): Promise<DetectAIOutput> {\n    const validation = DetectAIInputSchema.safeParse(input);\n    if (!validation.success) {\n        throw new Error(`Invalid input for detectAiContent: ${validation.error.message}`);\n    }\n    return detectAiContentFlow(validation.data);\n}\n', 'tool_response': "Successfully replaced code in src/modules/ai/infrastructure/flows/analysis/detect-ai-content.ts:\n\n--- src/modules/ai/infrastructure/flows/analysis/detect-ai-content.ts\n+++ src/modules/ai/infrastructure/flows/analysis/detect-ai-content.ts\n@@ -5,7 +5,7 @@\n  * @fileOverview An AI agent for detecting AI-generated content.\n  */\n \n-import { ai } from '@/modules/ai/infrastructure/services/Genkit';\n+import { ai, OLLAMA_MODELS } from '@/modules/ai/infrastructure/services/Genkit';\n import { DetectAIInputSchema, DetectAIOutputSchema, type DetectAIInput, type DetectAIOutput } from '@/modules/ai/domain/schemas';\n \n const detectAiPrompt = ai.definePrompt({\n"}
