\n  14     prompt: `You are an expert author and technical writer. Your task is to write the complete content for a chapter titled \\"{{chapterTitle}}\\".\\n  15 \\n  16 You will be given a list of sections to write for this chapter. For each section, you must follow its specific instructions, which include a base prompt, guidelines, and contextual information.\\n  17 \\n  18 Your final output must be a single markdown string. Each section must start with a level 2 markdown heading (e.g., \'## Section Title\'). Follow the order of the sections as provided in the instructions.\\n  19 \\n  20 **Chapter Title:**\\n  21 # {{chapterTitle}}\\n  22 \\n  23 **Sections to Generate:**\\n  24 {{#each sectionInstructions}}\\n  25 ---\\n  26 ### Instructions for Section: \\"{{this.title}}\\"\\n  27 \\n  28 **Base Prompt:**\\n  29 {{this.prompt}}\\n  30 \\n  31 **Guidelines:**\\n  32 {{#if this.guidelines}}\\n  33 {{#each this.guidelines}}\\n  34 - {{{this}}}\\n  35 {{/each}}\\n  36 {{else}}\\n  37 - No specific guidelines provided.\\n  38 {{/if}}\\n  39 \\n  40 **Additional Instructions:**\\n  41 {{this.instructionText}}\\n  42 \\n  43 **Context:**\\n  44 {{{this.context}}}\\n  45 ---\\n  46 {{/each}}\\n  47 `,\\n  48     config: {\\n  49         temperature: 0.5,\\n  50         maxOutputTokens: 8192,\\n  51     }\\n  52 });\\n  53 \\n  54 \\n  55 const generateChapterFlow = ai.defineFlow({\\n  56     name: \'generateChapterContentFlow\',\\n  57     inputSchema: GenerateChapterInputSchema,\\n  58     outputSchema: GenerateChapterOutputSchema,\\n  59 }, async (input: GenerateChapterInput) => {\\n  60     const { output } = await chapterPrompt(input);\\n  61 \\n  62     if (!output) {\\n  63         throw new Error(`The AI failed to generate a response for the chapter \\"${input.chapterTitle}\\". Please try again.`);\\n  64     }\\n  65 \\n  66     return output;\\n  67 });\\n  68 \\n  69 export async function generateChapterContent(input: GenerateChapterInput): Promise<GenerateChapterOutput> {\\n  70     const validation = GenerateChapterInputSchema.safeParse(input);\\n  71     if (!validation.success) {\\n  72         throw new Error(`Invalid input for generateChapterContent: ${validation.error.message}`);\\n  73     }\\n  74     return generateChapterFlow(validation.data);\\n  75 }\\n  76 \\n````", "Successfully opened src/modules/ai/infrastructure/flows/generation/generate-project-blueprint.ts:\\n\\n````typescript\\n   0 \'use server\';\\n   1 \\n   2 /**\\n   3  * @fileOverview An AI agent for generating comprehensive project blueprints for applications and websites.\\n   4  */\\n   5 \\n   6 import { ai } from \'@/modules/ai/infrastructure/services/Genkit\';\\n   7 import { GenerateProjectBlueprintInputSchema, GenerateProjectBlueprintOutputSchema, type GenerateProjectBlueprintInput, type GenerateProjectBlueprintOutput } from \'@/modules/ai/domain/schemas\';\\n   8 \\n   9 const generateProjectBlueprintFlow = ai.defineFlow({\\n  10     name: \'generateProjectBlueprintFlow\',\\n  11     inputSchema: GenerateProjectBlueprintInputSchema,\\n  12     outputSchema: GenerateProjectBlueprintOutputSchema\\n  13 }, async (input: GenerateProjectBlueprintInput) => {\\n  14     const { projectName, projectType, description, targetAudience, complexity, features, techStack, budget, timeline } = input;\\n  15 \\n  16     const blueprintPrompt = ai.definePrompt({\\n  17         name: \'projectBlueprintPrompt\',\\n  18         input: { schema: GenerateProjectBlueprintInputSchema },\\n  19         output: { schema: GenerateProjectBlueprintOutputSchema },\\n  20 \\n  21         system: `You are a senior software architect and project manager with 15+ years of experience. Your task is to create a comprehensive project blueprint for web or mobile application development based on the provided project details. The blueprint should outline the project overview, core features, technology stack recommendations, development phases, and best practices.`,\\n  22    