mentQualityToolOutput> => {\\n  29     const analysisPrompt = `You are an expert document quality analyst. Provide a comprehensive quality assessment of the following document.\\n  30 \\n  31 Document to analyze:\\n  32 {{text}}\\n  33 \\n  34 Document Type: {{documentType}}\\n  35 \\n  36 Analysis Requirements:\\n  37 ${input.checkGrammar ? \'✓ Grammar and Style Analysis\' : \'✗ Skip Grammar Analysis\'}\\n  38 ${input.checkStructure ? \'✓ Structure and Coherence Analysis\' : \'✗ Skip Structure Analysis\'}\\n  39 ${input.checkCitations ? `✓ Citation Analysis (${input.citationStyle || \'APA\'} style)` : \'✗ Skip Citation Analysis\'}\\n  40 ✓ Readability Analysis (Always included)\\n  41 \\n  42 Provide:\\n  43 \\n  44 1. **Overall Quality Score** (0-100):\\n  45    Calculate based on weighted average of enabled checks\\n  46 \\n  47 2. **Individual Scores** (0-100 each, only for enabled checks):\\n  48    ${input.checkGrammar ? \'- Grammar Score: Based on error density and severity\' : \'\'}\\n  49    ${input.checkStructure ? \'- Structure Score: Based on organization, coherence, logical flow\' : \'\'}\\n  50    ${input.checkCitations ? \'- Citation Score: Based on citation accuracy and completeness\' : \'\'}\\n  51    - Readability Score: Based on readability metrics and clarity\\n  52 \\n  53 3. **Summary**:\\n  54    - Strengths: List 3-5 key strengths of the document\\n  55    - Weaknesses: List 3-5 main areas needing improvement\\n  56    - Priority Improvements: Top 3 most impactful improvements to make\\n  57 \\n  58 4. **Detailed Analysis** (for each enabled check):\\n  59    ${input.checkGrammar ? `\\n  60    - Grammar Analysis:\\n  61      * Total issues found (categorized by type)\\n  62      * Most critical grammar issues\\n  63      * Style improvement suggestions\\n  64    ` : \'\'}\\n  65    ${input.checkStructure ? `\\n  66    - Structure Analysis:\\n  67      * Document organization assessment\\n  68      * Coherence and flow evaluation\\n  69      * Transition quality\\n  70      * Recommendations for restructuring\\n  71    ` : \'\'}\\n  72    ${input.checkCitations ? `\\n  73    - Citation Analysis:\\n  74      * Citation formatting issues\\n  75      * Missing or incomplete citations\\n  76      * Reference list problems\\n  77      * Citation-reference mismatches\\n  78    ` : \'\'}\\n  79    - Readability Analysis:\\n  80      * Readability metrics (Flesch scores, grade level)\\n  81      * Sentence and word complexity\\n  82      * Suggestions for improving clarity\\n  83 \\n  84 Provide actionable, specific feedback that will help the writer improve the document.`;\\n  85 \\n  86     const prompt = ai.definePrompt({\\n  87       name: \'documentQualityAnalyzerPrompt\',\\n  88       input: { schema: AnalyzeDocumentQualityToolInputSchema },\\n  89       output: { schema: AnalyzeDocumentQualityToolOutputSchema },\\n  90       model: OLLAMA_MODELS.GEMMA_2B,\\n  91       prompt: analysisPrompt,\\n  92     });\\n  93 \\n  94     const { output } = await prompt(input);\\n  95 \\n  96     if (!output) {\\n  97       throw new Error(\'Failed to analyze document quality\');\\n  98     }\\n  99 \\n 100     return output;\\n 101   }\\n 102 );\\n 103 \\n 104 // Export the tool\\n 105 export const comprehensiveAnalysisTools = {\\n 106   analyzeDocumentQuality: analyzeDocumentQualityTool,\\n 107 };\\n 108 \\n````"]'}
